---
import Icon from './Icon.astro'
---

<section id="about" class="about-section bg-surface py-16 md:py-24">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-heading text-center text-heading text-3xl font-bold mb-8 uppercase">
      <span>About Me</span>
    </h2>
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-body text-lg">
        <p class="mb-4">
          I am an <strong>AWS Certified Software Developer</strong> focused on Front-End development. My journey began in 2016 after completing the <strong
            >Web Development</strong
          >
          certification from <strong>IDB-BISEW</strong>. I have worked with <strong>HTML</strong>, <strong>CSS/SCSS</strong>, <strong
            >JavaScript/Typescript</strong
          >, <strong>jQuery</strong>, <strong>Angular</strong>, <strong>React</strong>, <strong>Next JS</strong>, <strong>Node JS</strong>, <strong>PHP</strong
          >, <strong>AWS</strong> and more.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-4">
          I am passionate about building new things and solving logical & technical problems. My passion drives me to learn, read, and practice new things as
          well as sharpen what I already know.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-4">Currently, I am learning Node.js, Python, CI/CD pipeline, Web Security, Testing Tools, and AWS.</p>
        <p class="mb-4">
          In my free time, I build small projects on <a href="https://github.com/meghsohor" class="text-primary underline" target="_blank">GitHub</a> and help others
          on <a href="https://stackoverflow.com/users/7646942/shuvo" class="text-primary underline" target="_blank">StackOverflow</a>.
        </p>
        <p>Besides my profession, I enjoy reading, cooking, and traveling. I hope to travel to different countries one day!</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="about-me-container">
    <div class="container text-center">
      <h5 class="uppercase text-muted mb-3">Socials</h5>
      <div class="flex justify-center gap-1">
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/meghsohor/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="linkedin social-link" aria-label="LinkedIn">
          <Icon name="linkedin" size="1.33em" />
        </a>
        <a href="https://github.com/meghsohor" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="github social-link" aria-label="GitHub">
          <Icon name="github" size="1.33em" />
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://stackoverflow.com/users/7646942/shuvo"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="stack-overflow social-link"
          aria-label="Stack Overflow"
        >
          <Icon name="stack-overflow" size="1.33em" />
        </a>
        <a href="https://twitter.com/meghsohor" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="twitter social-link" aria-label="Twitter">
          <Icon name="twitter" size="1.33em" />
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
